// MISTAKE: a payment before the book began was missed, so the lender's number is higher than the schedule's. The statement is held to the schedule that opened the debt, no payment of the book explains it, and `check` says so instead of blaming the 11 payments before the book.
base USD
use std

entity bank : lender
account checking : bank
asset condo : property

opening 2026-01-01
  checking 900_000 USD

contract mortgage with bank
  loan 120_000 USD on 2025-01-15 at 6% over 3y for condo
  monthly on 1 from checking
  from 2025-02-01

2026-01-01 mortgage
2026-01-31 mortgage = 85_048.55 USD
